{"root":"pli/ms","translators":["sujato"],"title":"Agreement: a past life story","html":"<article id='ja33'><header><ul><li class='division'><span class='root'>Jātaka </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>Stories of Past Lives 33 </span></li>\n<li><span class='root'>Ekakanipāta </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>The Book of the Ones </span></li>\n<li><span class='root'>Kulāvakavagga </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>Nests </span></li></ul>\n<h1 class='sutta-title'><span class='root'>3. Sammodamānajātaka </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>Agreement: a past life story </span></h1></header>\n<blockquote class='gatha'><p><span class='verse-line'><span class='root'>“Sammodamānā gacchanti, </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>In agreement, the birds fly, </span></span>\n<span class='verse-line'><span class='root'>jālamādāya pakkhino; </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>taking away the net. </span></span>\n<span class='verse-line'><span class='root'>Yadā te vivadissanti, </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>But when they start arguing </span></span>\n<span class='verse-line'><span class='root'>tadā ehinti me vasan”ti. </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>they’ll come under my sway. </span></span></p></blockquote>\n<p class='endsutta'><span class='root'>Sammodamānajātakaṁ tatiyaṁ. </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'></span></p></article>"}
